    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c09-t9.10-p008",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**উদাহরণ ৩০.** $f(x) = \\frac{x}{|x|}$, ফাংশনটির ডোমেন এবং রেঞ্জ নির্ণয় করো।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "f(x) = \\frac{x}{|x|}"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 219,
      "pdfPageEnd": 219,
      "printedPageStart": 214,
      "printedPageEnd": 214,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c09-t9.10-p009",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**সমাধান:** $f(0) = \\frac{0}{|0|} = \\frac{0}{0}$ যা অসংজ্ঞায়িত।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "f(0) = \\frac{0}{|0|} = \\frac{0}{0}"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 219,
      "pdfPageEnd": 219,
      "printedPageStart": 214,
      "printedPageEnd": 214,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c09-t9.10-p010",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "$\\therefore x = 0$ বিন্দুতে প্রদত্ত ফাংশনটি বিদ্যমান নয়। শূন্য ব্যতীত $x$ এর অন্য বাস্তব মানের জন্য প্রদত্ত ফাংশনটি বিদ্যমান।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\therefore x = 0",
        "x"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 219,
      "pdfPageEnd": 219,
      "printedPageStart": 214,
      "printedPageEnd": 214,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c09-t9.10-p011",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "$\\therefore$ ফাংশনের ডোমেন $D_f = R - \\{0\\}$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\therefore",
        "D_f = R - \\{0\\}"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 219,
      "pdfPageEnd": 219,
      "printedPageStart": 214,
      "printedPageEnd": 214,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
