    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c09-t9.10-p014",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**উদাহরণ ৩১.** $y = f(x) = \\ln \\frac{a + x}{a - x}$, $a > 0$ এবং পূর্ণসংখ্যা, ফাংশনটির ডোমেন ও রেঞ্জ নির্ণয় করো।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "y = f(x) = \\ln \\frac{a + x}{a - x}",
        "a > 0"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 219,
      "pdfPageEnd": 219,
      "printedPageStart": 214,
      "printedPageEnd": 214,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
