    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c09-t9.10-p018",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "(i) $a + x > 0$ এবং $a - x > 0$ হয় অথবা\n(ii) $a + x < 0$ এবং $a - x < 0$ হয় $(i) \\implies x > -a$ এবং $a > x$\n$$\\implies -a < x  এবং  x < a$$\n$\\therefore$ ডোমেন $= \\{x : -a < x\\} \\cap \\{x : x < a\\}$\n$$= (-a, \\infty) \\cap (-\\infty, a) = (-a, a)$$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "a + x > 0",
        "a - x > 0",
        "a + x < 0",
        "a - x < 0",
        "(i) \\implies x > -a",
        "a > x",
        "\\implies -a < x  এবং  x < a",
        "\\therefore",
        "= \\{x : -a < x\\} \\cap \\{x : x < a\\}",
        "= (-a, \\infty) \\cap (-\\infty, a) = (-a, a)"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 219,
      "pdfPageEnd": 220,
      "printedPageStart": 214,
      "printedPageEnd": 215,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "latin-junk",
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c09-t9.10-p019",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "$(ii) \\implies x < -a$ এবং $a < x$\n$$\\implies x < -a  এবং  x > a$$\n$\\therefore$ ডোমেন $= \\{x : x < -a\\} \\cap \\{x : x > a\\} = \\varnothing$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "(ii) \\implies x < -a",
        "a < x",
        "\\implies x < -a  এবং  x > a",
        "\\therefore",
        "= \\{x : x < -a\\} \\cap \\{x : x > a\\} = \\varnothing"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 220,
      "pdfPageEnd": 220,
      "printedPageStart": 215,
      "printedPageEnd": 215,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c09-t9.10-p020",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "$\\therefore$ প্রদত্ত ফাংশনের ডোমেন $D_f = (i)  ও  (ii)  থেকে প্রাপ্ত ডোমেনের সংযোগ  (-a, a) \\cup \\varnothing = (-a, a)$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\therefore",
        "D_f = (i)  ও  (ii)  থেকে প্রাপ্ত ডোমেনের সংযোগ  (-a, a) \\cup \\varnothing = (-a, a)"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 220,
      "pdfPageEnd": 220,
      "printedPageStart": 215,
      "printedPageEnd": 215,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c09-t9.10-p021",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**রেঞ্জ:** $y = f(x) = \\ln \\frac{a + x}{a - x} \\implies e^y = \\frac{a + x}{a - x}$\n$$\\implies a + x = ae^y - xe^y$$\n$$\\implies x + xe^y = ae^y - a$$\n$$\\implies (1 + e^y)x = a(e^y - 1)$$\n$$\\implies x = \\frac{a(e^y - 1)}{e^y + 1}$$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "y = f(x) = \\ln \\frac{a + x}{a - x} \\implies e^y = \\frac{a + x}{a - x}",
        "\\implies a + x = ae^y - xe^y",
        "\\implies x + xe^y = ae^y - a",
        "\\implies (1 + e^y)x = a(e^y - 1)",
        "\\implies x = \\frac{a(e^y - 1)}{e^y + 1}"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 220,
      "pdfPageEnd": 220,
      "printedPageStart": 215,
      "printedPageEnd": 215,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
